    "title": "What Time Does Sabrina Carpenter Go on Stage? Timing Explained",
    "text": "Sabrina Carpenter‘s Short n’ Sweet tour is going strong, and fans eager to attend the singer’s concerts are wondering what time she goes on stage and how long she’ll perform. Upon release, Carpenter’s Short n’ Sweet album hit the number one spot on the US Billboard 200 charts. The album also received an RIAA platinum certification, a first for Carpenter.So, what time does Sabrina Carpenter go on stage for the Short n’ Sweer tour? Here is your answer.What time does Sabrina Carpenter go on stage?The time Sabrina Carpenter goes on stage typically ranges between 8:30 p.m. and 10:00 p.m. However, this can vary if technical issues or venue curfew times face any significant changes.For instance, during her opening night in Columbus, Ohio, Carpenter went on stage at 8:35 p.m. and left at 10:05 p.m.. Then, in her show in Baltimore, Maryland, she commenced her performance at 8:30 and concluded at 10:00 p.m.These are the typical times for Sabrina Carpenter’s Short n’ Sweet tour schedule:Doors Open at 6:00 p.m.Support Act begins at 7:00 p.m. (Carpenter’s support act includes Amaarae, Griff, Declan McKenna, and Rachel Chinouriri)Sabrina Carpenter’s performance begins at 8:30 p.m.Show concludes at 10:00 p.m.However, her most recent show in Philadelphia, Pennsylvania, had a slight difference: the Support Act began half an hour later, at 7:30 p.m.According to the official website, Carpenter is next scheduled to play in Montreal, Canada, on October 11, 2024.Carpenter’s Short n’ Sweet tour setlist comprises 21 songs. She has also so far played the following surprise songs which are:ABBA – Mamma Mia – Columbus, Ohio (September 23)Shania Twain – That Don’t Impress Me Much – Toronto, Canada (September 25)Sixpence None The Richer – Kiss Me – Detroit, Michigan (September 26)Mamma Mia – New York City (September 29)Sabrina Carpenter – Busy Woman – Brooklyn, New York (September 30)Kiss Me – Hartford, Connecticut (October 2)Mamma Mia – Boston, Massachusetts (October 3)Material Girl – Madonna – Baltimore, Maryland (October 5)Busy Woman – Philadelphia, Pennsylvania (October 8)The Short n’ Sweet tour, which kicked off on September 23, is scheduled to conclude in Milan, Italy, on March 26, 2025.The post What Time Does Sabrina Carpenter Go on Stage? Timing Explained appeared first on ComingSoon.net - Movie Trailers, TV & Streaming News, and More.",
